# Open-work inventory

`docs/open-work.md` is the only current unfinished inventory. Follow [docs/AGENTS.md](docs/AGENTS.md).

## Before claiming done

If the change adds, finishes, defers, or live-accepts unfinished work, edit `docs/open-work.md` in the **same change** (or same session before done). Do not leave the inventory for the user to remember.

## At the start of unfinished work

When a change will leave **not implemented** or **awaiting live acceptance** items, put an `open-work` todo on the list immediately and keep it until the file is updated.

## How to edit

- **Not implemented**: code still missing.
- **Awaiting live acceptance**: code exists; new city; previous save is not the gate.
- When implemented, **delete** the not-implemented bullet — do not move it to a “please accept” list.
- Delete passed live-acceptance gates; keep or re-add failed / never-triggered ones.
- Do not grow this file into a changelog, scoreboard, or ops note.
